From b352212c5ce61a00c21a3719b7b68982a1ac788c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SignKirigami <prcups@krgm.moe>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:55:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] AOSCOS: Revert "Drop Xorg bits"

Upstream-Id: abd900f5b5800d1273852e9a5e5098de91278f23

Keep KWin 6.8 direct event handling and normalized shortcut lookup. Add a
compatibility interface and registry-owned XCB plugin loader so the
standalone X11 daemon can register grabs without replacing the Wayland input
path.

Assisted-by: deepseek-v4-flash
Signed-off-by: SignKirigami <prcups@krgm.moe>
